From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: test <test@example.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:04:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: delete and drag-select gifts

Bulk delete of the picked gifts (basic, not refunded, owned here) with a permanent-delete confirmation and Stars lock, counters and local list removal like the single-gift menu. While picking, a long press starts a range drag: the anchor decides select or unselect, gifts outside the range return to their pre-drag state. Port of desktop 0340.
